# Keep the Docker build context free of secrets, host-specific files and clutter.

# Secrets / environment
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.env_*
!.env.example
**/.vercel

# Host virtualenv (the image builds its own with `uv sync`) and caches
**/.venv
env
venv
ENV
env.bak
venv.bak
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.ruff_cache

# Version control, local runtime output and private source material
**/.git
logs
**/*.log
**/*.log.*
vapi_configs
**/.claude
**/CLAUDE.md
**/HANDOFF.md
**/tmp*
